    "text": "21 hours ago The Georgia Bureau of Investigation is investigating the death of a South Carolina man following a traffic stop on Interstate 75 in Bartow County. At the request of the Georgia State Patrol and the Adairsville Police Department, GBI agents are examining the death of 40-year-old Nicholas Marino of Graniteville, South Carolina. Read full article\n4",
